{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No matter how strong or young you are now, one day you're gonna be old, weak, and sick... Who's gonna take care of you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a linear short horror experience for gamers who enjoy unsettling and crazy horror narratives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and interact with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and run for your life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s story is the centerpiece, it drives the entire experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 40 minutes to 1 hour of gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-third of this game was released three years ago. Now, it's coming to Steam with a lot more content and improvements. If you played the older version, you'll find plenty of new things in this one, it's even scarier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>For the best experience, play alone, in a dark room, with headphones.</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying this game, you're supporting the development of <i>Deadly Chance</i>, MKdir Studio's biggest project coming soon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815470?t=1769368303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815470/d53a973dee02f47c3908596a11aa287e32b92c9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769368303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815470/74891cc69c941a72f0997f968edbb0ac8b1b5314/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769368303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815470/74891cc69c941a72f0997f968edbb0ac8b1b5314/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769368303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"this game contains scenes of explicit violence and gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No matter how strong or young you are now, one day you're gonna be old, weak, and sick... Who's gonna take care of you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a linear short horror experience for gamers who enjoy unsettling and crazy horror narratives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and interact with unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and run for your life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s story is the centerpiece, it drives the entire experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 40 minutes to 1 hour of gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-third of this game was released three years ago. Now, it's coming to Steam with a lot more content and improvements. If you played the older version, you'll find plenty of new things in this one, it's even scarier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>For the best experience, play alone, in a dark room, with headphones.</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By buying this game, you're supporting the development of <i>Deadly Chance</i>, MKdir Studio's biggest project coming soon!</p>","developers":[" MKdir Studio"],"genres":[{"description